# Example Mosquitto password file for development.
#
# DO NOT USE THIS FILE IN PRODUCTION.
#
# Generate a real password file on the broker machine using `mosquitto_passwd`,
# and point `mosquitto-dev.conf` at it (default: `config/mosquitto-passwords`).
#
# Example:
#
#   mosquitto_passwd -c config/mosquitto-passwords france-bot
#   mosquitto_passwd  config/mosquitto-passwords tooter-bot
#
#
# Line format (after running `mosquitto_passwd`):
#   username:hashed-password
#
# Example (hashes shown here are placeholders, not real):
#   france-bot:$7$101$abcdefghijklmnop$XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
#   tooter-bot:$7$101$qrstuvwxyzabcdef$YYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYY

